  NoteName: Island Note
  NoteHeader: Crewmate's Diary (2/3)
  NoteText: "Resouces and hope are growing thin, and all my crew are all losing their
    mind. \nDelusions are getting to them, we found this huge dead fish, with massive
    tusks, and all they talked about when around it was how it was a blessing of
    some upper power.\nThe worlds endlessly looping nature is ruining them, it feels
    like I can't even turn to them anymore"
